{
    "word": "cleanskin",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "cc2de34f-d043-3216-bc8f-78fe8f067730",
                "word": "cleanskin",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ccfa0d39-0292-4670-856f-f7d7a16be870",
                        "entry_id": "cc2de34f-d043-3216-bc8f-78fe8f067730",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "cleanskins"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8976cf8f-f140-3184-ac6e-1e7ffa5f2b83",
                        "entry_id": "cc2de34f-d043-3216-bc8f-78fe8f067730",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An unbranded animal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "572454ba-b89b-42cd-8fe2-009bfc218b2e",
                                "sense_id": "8976cf8f-f140-3184-ac6e-1e7ffa5f2b83",
                                "text": "No one had any clear notion of how many head might be collected, but we counted on something over four hundred--possibly up to five hundred and fifty, including calves and cleanskins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a11c2dc6-a706-4730-89f9-6afe9d6e44b6",
                                "sense_id": "8976cf8f-f140-3184-ac6e-1e7ffa5f2b83",
                                "text": "I started off lassoing the cleanskins, dragging them up bellowing to the bronco panel where they were quickly leg-roped, thrown and branded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e69ebf0e-7e64-4b6a-92e1-6164c24020f8",
                                "sense_id": "8976cf8f-f140-3184-ac6e-1e7ffa5f2b83",
                                "text": "The bullocks would be in the lead and you'd whip in and let the bullocks go to hell, but hang to your cleanskins as much as you could."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9714c43e-9b7b-3554-a2b7-b5ce00a67eb9",
                        "entry_id": "cc2de34f-d043-3216-bc8f-78fe8f067730",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who does not have any tattoos."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0480638a-fd22-4120-b5a4-e8d7443af94d",
                                "sense_id": "9714c43e-9b7b-3554-a2b7-b5ce00a67eb9",
                                "text": "If you're under 18 in Victoria you must now remain a cleanskin. The Government has just passed a bill that minors must not be tattooed with or without their parent's consent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0217cba8-2530-4490-b7d6-9597f88555f9",
                                "sense_id": "9714c43e-9b7b-3554-a2b7-b5ce00a67eb9",
                                "text": "Both men and women are tattooed, and so important are tattoos for traditional Samoans that it is impossible to serve or be apprenticed to a village leader if you are a cleanskin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "440b2eb3-3647-40f1-913a-de31050f6e98",
                                "sense_id": "9714c43e-9b7b-3554-a2b7-b5ce00a67eb9",
                                "text": "And it had been the witness ID of his tattoos that had sunk him. Now with a forged passport he was going back to the Continent a new man, if not a cleanskin."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e9ee3be7-f457-349c-ae95-6d9f82bc2dfe",
                        "entry_id": "cc2de34f-d043-3216-bc8f-78fe8f067730",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone with no prior criminal record, a person with no previous convictions; loosely, someone who has not done anything wrong before, an unblemished character."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fd895f4-05e9-4b81-9167-f7a62ec2ded1",
                                "sense_id": "e9ee3be7-f457-349c-ae95-6d9f82bc2dfe",
                                "text": "Ryan′s natural father was a cleanskin – a police term for a person with no criminal history – who found himself caught up in the world of career criminals when he married into The Clan."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3336490-b7ca-4648-bdbb-172d34c297b2",
                                "sense_id": "e9ee3be7-f457-349c-ae95-6d9f82bc2dfe",
                                "text": "So the only strategy likely to hurt Clegg in those circumstances involves arguing that the Lib Dems are part of the mould too – not cleanskins, but a party with 60-plus MPs in that last discredited parliament."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1d871a16-fc30-3207-9c41-bdd7b6470ee3",
                        "entry_id": "cc2de34f-d043-3216-bc8f-78fe8f067730",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An unlabelled bottle of wine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "New-Zealand"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b52cddc-8138-4f2e-9c7f-06a9adc08305",
                                "sense_id": "1d871a16-fc30-3207-9c41-bdd7b6470ee3",
                                "text": "Mr McKenzie said that two years ago a decent bottle of sauvignon blanc sold for $15 to $20, but today prices were down to $10 a bottle. \"More cleanskins entering the market is the first indication there is too much SB out there,\" he said."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14d21843-a660-438f-84f3-6b27b6f5043a",
                                "sense_id": "1d871a16-fc30-3207-9c41-bdd7b6470ee3",
                                "text": "In 2009, Back Label commissioned Voice to design a label for its cleanskin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5adf2abf-e891-4e5e-988d-8ae4033e58b7",
                                "sense_id": "1d871a16-fc30-3207-9c41-bdd7b6470ee3",
                                "text": "My eye-whites still woke up bright and clear despite the night before's two bottles of cheap cleanskin wine."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15b762cd-fac9-39b3-b731-fd9f01f6c39e",
                        "entry_id": "cc2de34f-d043-3216-bc8f-78fe8f067730",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An undercover police officer who has not done a particular task before."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
